<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT &amp; DATA</view><view class="title">我的</view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">个人目标</view><view wx:if="{{profile}}"><view class="row"><text>管理方向</text><text class="pill">{{goalLabel}}</text></view><view class="row"><text class="muted">身高</text><text>{{profile.height_cm}} cm</text></view><view class="row"><text class="muted">目标体重</text><text>{{profile.target_weight}} kg</text></view><navigator url="/pages/plan/plan" class="link">调整计划与目标 ›</navigator></view><view wx:else class="muted">请先在首页完成设置</view></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view><view class="section-title">提醒偏好</view><view class="muted">微信订阅消息需另配模板；此处保存提醒偏好。</view></view><switch checked="{{reminderEnabled}}" bindchange="onReminder" color="#286c55" /></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">数据与连接</view><view class="muted">开发机 API 地址（手机调试时填写电脑局域网 IP）</view><input class="input" value="{{apiUrl}}" bindinput="onUrl"/><button class="button button-light" bindtap="saveUrl">保存 API 地址</button><button class="button button-light" bindtap="useWechatLogin">使用微信登录（需服务端配置）</button><button class="button" bindtap="exportCsv">导出 CSV</button><button class="button button-light" bindtap="exportBackup">导出 JSON 备份</button><view class="muted">基于当前数据安全规则，暂不提供导入覆盖与历史记录编辑/删除。</view></view><view class="muted">本地开发无需 AppID。服务端不会向小程序返回密钥。</view></view>
